256" :answer-field/choices "answer-60e32486-7db9-572e-bf0b-abb0511aec74"] ["answer-field-3eb65b3e-6b41-59b0-9d94-518769d72256" :answer-field/choices "answer-e777fd40-075b-5a8d-88b7-24757d97d60b"] ["question-faab7281-1d54-5c27-a108-8672d8a7d7bc" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-3eb65b3e-6b41-59b0-9d94-518769d72256"] [17592186092264 :knowledge-point/questions "question-faab7281-1d54-5c27-a108-8672d8a7d7bc"] [17592186233100 :question/problem "Find the equation of the tangent to the curve $f(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(4-2x)$ at the point $(1,\\operatorname{ln}⁡2).$"] [17592186233100 :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f(x)$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf=\\operatorname{ln}⁡u,\\,u=4-2x.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{u},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-2.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{u}\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4-2x}\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{4-2x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\cancel{2}}{\\cancel{2}\\cdot (2-x)} \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2-x}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent line at the point where $x=1$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={-\\frac{1}{2-x}|}_{x=1}=-\\frac{1}{2-1}=-1\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, the slope of the tangent line at the point $(1,\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)$ is $m=-1.$ Now, we find the equation of the tangent at that point:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2 & =-1(x-1) \\\\ y & =-x+1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/id #uuid "499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e"] ["answer-011261f6-f670-587f-9bdd-9a520a83e6ba" :answer/id #uuid "011261f6-f670-587f-9bdd-9a520a83e6ba"] ["answer-011261f6-f670-587f-9bdd-9a520a83e6ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-011261f6-f670-587f-9bdd-9a520a83e6ba" :answer/value "y=-x+1"] ["answer-6c6fa548-c78e-5183-aee5-05878a4f08f9" :answer/id #uuid "6c6fa548-c78e-5183-aee5-05878a4f08f9"] ["answer-6c6fa548-c78e-5183-aee5-05878a4f08f9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6c6fa548-c78e-5183-aee5-05878a4f08f9" :answer/value "y=-x+1+4\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["answer-6007a77d-8635-5b6c-baa1-e41d26c907eb" :answer/id #uuid "6007a77d-8635-5b6c-baa1-e41d26c907eb"] ["answer-6007a77d-8635-5b6c-baa1-e41d26c907eb" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6007a77d-8635-5b6c-baa1-e41d26c907eb" :answer/value "y=-x+1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["answer-ed876f04-a32c-5ff4-8888-d57182793668" :answer/id #uuid "ed876f04-a32c-5ff4-8888-d57182793668"] ["answer-ed876f04-a32c-5ff4-8888-d57182793668" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-ed876f04-a32c-5ff4-8888-d57182793668" :answer/value "y=-x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["answer-edf7f618-406b-55ec-a4b0-ea2a3cc3aa13" :answer/id #uuid "edf7f618-406b-55ec-a4b0-ea2a3cc3aa13"] ["answer-edf7f618-406b-55ec-a4b0-ea2a3cc3aa13" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-edf7f618-406b-55ec-a4b0-ea2a3cc3aa13" :answer/value "y=-x-1-3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/correct "answer-6007a77d-8635-5b6c-baa1-e41d26c907eb"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/choices "answer-011261f6-f670-587f-9bdd-9a520a83e6ba"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/choices "answer-6c6fa548-c78e-5183-aee5-05878a4f08f9"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/choices "answer-6007a77d-8635-5b6c-baa1-e41d26c907eb"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/choices "answer-ed876f04-a32c-5ff4-8888-d57182793668"] ["answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e" :answer-field/choices "answer-edf7f618-406b-55ec-a4b0-ea2a3cc3aa13"] [17592186233100 :question/answer-fields "answer-field-499c195b-8d64-5d7d-9d3e-bb9baebdfb2e"] ["question-694c8d1d-6f8f-5d0d-9977-6900e2cfbc80" :question/id #uuid "694c8d1d-6f8f-5d0d-9977-6900e2cfbc80"] ["question-694c8d1d-6f8f-5d0d-9977-6900e2cfbc80" :question/math-academy-id "q-107472"] ["question-694c8d1d-6f8f-5d0d-9977-6900e2cfbc80" :question/problem "Find the equation of the tangent to the curve $y=\\operatorname{log}⁡(4x+6)$ at the point $(1,1).$"] ["question-694c8d1d-6f8f-5d0d-9977-6900e2cfbc80" :question/worked-solution "First, we need to find the slope of the tangent line. The slope is equal to the derivative of the curve at the given point:\n\n$$\nm=\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}{|}_{x=1}\n$$\n\nTo compute $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we first express $y$ as the composite function\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{log}⁡(u),\\,u=4x+6.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}=\\frac{1}{u\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=4.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule, and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{u\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{(4x+6)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(2x+3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope $m$ of the tangent line at the point where $x=1$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}m & =\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}{|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(2x+3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}{|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{(2(1)+3)\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we know that the slope of the tangent line at the point $(1,1)$ is $m=\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}.$ Finally, we find the equation of the tangent line at that point:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-1 & =\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}(x-1) \\\\ y & =\\frac{2x}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}-\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡10}+1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-694c8d1d-6f8f-5d0d-9977-6900e2cfbc80" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-12a6637d-3fa8-57d6-a18a-381344c8f764" :answer-field/id #uuid "12a6637d-3fa8-57d6-a18a-381344c8f764"] ["answer-35a68164-9e76-57b2-aab1-2d80d9c78b2c" :answer/id #uuid "35a68164-9e76-57b2-aab1-2d80d9c78b2c"] ["answer-35a68164-9e76-57b2-aab1-2d80d9c78b2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-35a68164-9e76-57b2-aab1-2d80d9c78b2c" :answer/value "y=-\\frac{2x}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}+\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}+1"] ["answer-06923402-c07c-528b-a298-0b8a71448268" :answer/id #uuid "06923402-c07c-528b-a298-0b8a71448268"] ["answer-06923402-c07c-528b-a298-0b8a71448268" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-06923402-c07c-528b-a298-0b8a71448268" :answer/value "y=\\frac{2x}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}+1"] ["answer-0677b7f9-d152-5eed-97e5-8f5592a31657" :answer/id #uuid "0677b7f9-d152-5eed-97e5-8f5592a31657"] ["answer-0677b7f9-d152-5eed-97e5-8f5592a31657" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0677b7f9-d152-5eed-97e5-8f5592a31657" :answer/value "y=\\frac{2x}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}-\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}"] ["answer-2ede9697-6d3d-5e61-a427-35aecef7a252" :answer/id #uuid "2ede9697-6d3d-5e61-a427-35aecef7a252"] ["answer-2ede9697-6d3d-5e61-a427-35aecef7a252" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-2ede9697-6d3d-5e61-a427-35aecef7a252" :answer/value "y=\\frac{2x}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}-\\frac{2}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}+1"] ["answer-b233612d-1ef2-5a1d-af72-2a0729071ac6" :answer/id #uuid "b233612d-1ef2-5a1d-af72-2a0729071ac6"] ["answer-b233612d-1ef2-5a1d-af72-2a0729071ac6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b233612d-1ef2-5a1d-af72-2a0729071ac6" :answer/value "y=\\frac{2x}{5\\operatorname{ln}⁡(10)}-\\frac{3}{5}"] ["answer-field-12a6637d-3fa8-57d6-a18a-381344c8f764" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answ